   "per_seed_identical": true,
   "detail": "Decision-identical on all 30 seeds. sample_batch consumes the RNG in the same order as the per-source eval loop (identical streams), and with the trained tanh(raw_w) > 0 the SignedScalar decision reduces to sign(2*cons - 1) * (2*m_q - 1) -- the same sign rule as w = log(p/(1-p)) with p = cons (the [0.05, 0.95] clip never changes a sign). The parameter-free log-odds scalar therefore IS the trained SignedScalar as a decision rule on this protocol."
  },
